  "description": "Istio configuration analysis health (EE). Shows findings from the periodic analyzer (same engine as istioctl analyze): issue counts by type/severity/namespace, trends over time, and the current issue list with Message text. Filter by revision, namespace, severity, and type. Click a Code to open Istio analysis docs. Note: InvalidApplicationUID (IST0144) often appears for Deckhouse Istio components that intentionally use UID 1337.",
